{
  "_readme": [
    "SEED CATALOGUE — editorial, not derived.",
    "",
    "Each row is [player, season, team, region, role, ovr, accolades, championKeys].",
    "The player-seasons, teams, regions, roles and accolades are real. The OVR is an",
    "editorial seed rating; the sub-stats, champion games, win rates and season lines are",
    "generated deterministically from it by scripts/build-catalogue.mjs.",
    "",
    "Nothing here is derived from match data, and every card built from this file carries",
    "provenance.source = 'SEED' so the card back and the app say so. Replace the whole",
    "thing by running scripts/ingest-leaguepedia.mjs, which computes real ratings from",
    "real games; this file exists so the app has a catalogue on day one.",
    "",
    "Champion ids are Data Dragon keys: LeBlanc is Leblanc, Lee Sin is LeeSin, Wukong is",
    "MonkeyKing, Kai'Sa is Kaisa."
  ],
